  "lessons": [
    "v5 keeps the v4.1 trunk (threat + card-conditioned placement) and adds an anti-detector objective.",
    "The style judge is non-differentiable (HGB+ExtraTrees), so training uses differentiable moment matching on timing/placement tells plus REINFORCE against frozen P(human).",
    "REINFORCE rollouts use the action-clock for who-acts-next so harness tells (forced alternation) are not baked into every negative.",
    "Harness features are neutralized in the training reward; full-judge fool rate is the public metric.",
    "Checkpoint selection maximizes slot@1 + 0.35\u00b7P(human) so style gains that destroy cloning are rejected.",
    "Judge style offline before any live play; a higher P(human) with collapsed slot@1 is a failure."
  ],
